story2/videos_v1_bak/
story2/output/
story2/voice_lines/
story2/subs/
story2/__pycache__/
story2/shot_*_kf*.png

# ── 权重（几十 GB，绝不入库；靠下载脚本/手工拉，见 models/ 说明）──
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.gguf
*.h5
*.msgpack
*.onnx

# 权重根目录：LTX-Video 2B fp8 + MiniMax-H3 量化版都放这里（约 40 GB 落盘）
models/
# ComfyUI 官方工作流模板是从 Comfy-Org/workflow_templates 现拉的，不入库
tools/_h3src/

# ── CosyVoice2 模型 ──
cosyvoice2/pretrained_models/
cosyvoice2/cosy_env/

